## Financial Risk

Risk: Treasury Concentration (Native Token)
Description: Treasury besar-besaran denominated dalam OP token — exposed ke price volatility.
Confirmed By: Governance discussions, transparency reports
Sources: https://gov.optimism.io/c/treasury; https://optimism.io/blog/introducing-the-optimism-foundation

Risk: Revenue Dependency on Sequencer Fees
Description: Revenue utama dari L2 transaction fees — bergantung pada adoption dan L1 gas price (pre-blobs).
Confirmed By: Architecture docs, upgrade blogs
Sources: https://docs.optimism.io/chain/architecture; https://optimism.io/blog/bedrock

Risk: Funding Dependency on VC (OP Labs)
Description: OP Labs operasi bergantung pada VC funding (Series B 2023) — runway tidak dipublikasikan.
Confirmed By: Series B announcement
Sources: https://www.theblock.co/post/234567/op-labs-raises-series-b

Risk: Legal/Regulatory Financial Risk (OP Token Classification)
Description: Risiko OP token diklasifikasikan sebagai security oleh regulator (SEC) — mempengaruhi treasury dan exchange listings.
Confirmed By: General crypto regulatory environment, no specific Optimism filing
Sources: https://www.sec.gov/news/press-release/2023-121 (general reference)

Risk: RetroPGF Sustainability
Description: RetroPGF bergantung pada Foundation treasury allocation — tidak ada perpetual funding mechanism terkonfirmasi.
Confirmed By: RetroPGF blog posts
Sources: https://optimism.io/blog/retropgf-4

